#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:8
msgid "Portable OS tasks, waits and static storage"
msgstr "可移植 OS：任务、等待与静态存储"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:10
msgid ""
"These declarations come from public header files. Selection, lifecycle, "
"supported execution modes and physical authorization remain bounded by the "
"corresponding design and support records."
msgstr "这些声明来自公共头文件。选择、生命周期、支持的执行模式和物理资源授权范围仍以对应设计及支持记录为准。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:12
msgid ""
"Business code includes the common opaque task, notification, queue and "
"channel interfaces. Assembly code includes `storage.h` for the selected "
"backend's exact layout. Each executable links one backend implementation. "
"Backend extensions remain explicit; these declarations do not establish "
"final software or HIL qualification."
msgstr ""
"业务代码包含公共的不透明任务、通知、队列和通道接口。装配代码包含 "
"`storage.h`，取得所选后端的精确布局。每个可执行文件只链接一个后端实现。后端扩展保持显式；这些声明不建立最终软件或 HIL 验收资格。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:20
msgid "task.h"
msgstr "task.h"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Portable static tasks and absolute execution budgets."
msgstr "可移植静态任务与绝对执行预算。"

