msgid "Typedefs"
msgstr "类型定义"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Returning task; only storage.h completes the selected layout."
msgstr "可返回任务；仅 storage.h 补全所选后端布局。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Permanent task without join-completion storage."
msgstr "永久任务，不包含 join 完成同步存储。"

