msgstr "函数"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Enter the selected kernel through its real bootstrap."
msgstr "通过所选内核的真实引导流程进入内核。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"One cold privileged lifecycle owner. Platform startup is separate. Bootstrap"
" only uses declared nonblocking object construction operations. Native parks"
" this calling thread after startup; it does not create a hidden coordinator."
" Kernel return cannot authorize resource reclamation."
msgstr ""
"由一个冷态特权生命周期所有者调用。Platform 启动与此分开。引导阶段仅使用明确允许的非阻塞对象构建操作。Native "
"在启动回调结束后使调用线程驻留等待，不创建隐藏协调线程。内核返回不表示资源可以回收。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Non-NULL application bootstrap callback"
msgstr "[in] 非 NULL 的应用引导回调"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Borrowed bootstrap context"
msgstr "[in] 借用的引导上下文"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "INVALID/CONTEXT before entry; success never returns"
msgstr "进入前可返回 INVALID/CONTEXT；成功进入后不返回"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Read the selected OS deadline domain in microseconds."
msgstr "以微秒读取所选 OS 的截止时间域。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"Native uses CLOCK_MONOTONIC, independent of model clocks; MCU backends use "
"Core time. Keep the domain live through waits, drain and join. Zero alone "
"does not prove readiness."
msgstr ""
"Native 使用 CLOCK_MONOTONIC，与模型时钟独立；MCU 后端使用 Core 时间。等待、排空和 join "
"期间必须保持该时间域有效。仅凭零值不能证明时钟就绪。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Monotonic time; the physical clock must already be live"
msgstr "单调时间；物理时钟必须已经有效运行"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Start a returning task in caller-owned static storage."
msgstr "在调用者拥有的静态存储中启动可返回任务。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"Task/bootstrap only. Prepare all borrowed state before calling: entry may "
"run before start returns. One external owner serializes start/join. Known "
"control/stack overlap and wrapping spans reject before kernel effects. A "
"cleanup failure retains its resources and the same object storage."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务／引导阶段。调用前准备好所有被借用的状态：入口可能在 start 返回前执行。由一个外部所有者串行执行 "
"start/join。已知的控制对象／栈重叠及地址范围回绕在产生内核效果前拒绝。清理失败时保留相关资源及同一对象存储。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[inout] Zeroed unused object, retained until successful join"
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的未使用对象，保留到 join 成功"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Nonempty name retained until join"
msgstr "[in] 非空名称，保留到 join"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Aligned native stack array, retained until join"
msgstr "[in] 对齐的原生栈数组，保留到 join"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Actual byte capacity, not a word count"
msgstr "[in] 实际字节容量，不是字数"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Logical priority; larger values are higher"
msgstr "[in] 逻辑优先级；数值越大，优先级越高"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Non-NULL application entry, allowed to return"
msgstr "[in] 非 NULL 的应用入口，允许返回"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Entry context retained until successful join"
msgstr "[in] 入口上下文，保留到 join 成功"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "SUCCESS or argument, context, creation or resource error"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或参数、上下文、创建及资源错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Join only after the actual kernel releases task references."
msgstr "仅在真实内核解除任务引用后完成 join。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"Running task only. No forced cancellation or detach. Entry return and "
"completion notification do not replace join. Quiesce all other users before "
"reclaiming caller storage."
msgstr "仅限运行中的任务。不强制取消或 detach。入口返回和完成通知不能代替 join。回收调用者存储前，必须使其他所有使用者静默退出。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[inout] Live task, owned by one external joiner"
msgstr "[inout] 有效任务，由一个外部 joiner 拥有"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[in] Absolute OS deadline or NX_DEADLINE_NEVER"
msgstr "[in] 绝对 OS 截止时间或 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"SUCCESS permits reuse; TIMEOUT retains every resource; CONTEXT rejects self-"
"join or an unsafe execution context"
msgstr "SUCCESS 允许重用；TIMEOUT 保留全部资源；CONTEXT 拒绝 self-join 或不安全的执行上下文"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Withdraw a task that has never executed before scheduling."
msgstr "在调度前撤回从未执行过的任务。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"Native tasks can execute immediately and reject this call. This operation "
"never cancels or joins an executed task."
msgstr "Native 任务可能立即执行，因此拒绝此调用。该操作绝不取消或 join 已经执行过的任务。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[inout] Created, unused task under its unique startup owner"
msgstr "[inout] 已创建但未执行的任务，由唯一启动所有者管理"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after actual deletion; CONTEXT outside the supported pre-scheduler "
"phase; failure retains its references"
msgstr "实际删除后返回 SUCCESS；超出所支持的调度器启动前阶段时返回 CONTEXT；失败时保留相关引用"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Start a permanent task without a completion object."
msgstr "启动不带完成对象的永久任务。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"Task/bootstrap only. No join, destroy or detach is implied. Unexpected entry"
" return enters fail-stop. Storage survives until reset or separately "
"reviewed external termination."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务／引导阶段。不隐含 join、destroy 或 detach。入口意外返回将进入 fail-stop。存储保留到复位或另经审查的外部终止。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[inout] Zeroed unused static control"
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的未使用静态控制对象"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Nonempty name retained for the task lifetime"
msgstr "[in] 非空名称，保留整个任务生命周期"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Aligned caller stack retained for the lifetime"
msgstr "[in] 对齐的调用者栈，保留整个生命周期"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Actual byte capacity"
msgstr "[in] 实际字节容量"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Logical priority supported by the selected backend"
msgstr "[in] 所选后端支持的逻辑优先级"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Application entry that must never return"
msgstr "[in] 不得返回的应用入口"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Context retained for the task lifetime"
msgstr "[in] 上下文，保留整个任务生命周期"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "SUCCESS or an admission/creation error"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或准入／创建错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Sleep until a finite absolute OS deadline."
msgstr "休眠到有限的绝对 OS 截止时间。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"Running task only. Expired deadlines return immediately. No device service "
"or timer worker is implicit. Tick rounding and scheduling can delay return; "
"precision is not one us."
msgstr "仅限运行中的任务。截止时间已过期时立即返回。不隐含设备服务或定时器工作线程。Tick 取整和调度可能延迟返回，不保证 1 us 精度。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "[in] Finite deadline in nx_os_now_us domain"
msgstr "[in] nx_os_now_us 时间域中的有限截止时间"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after expiration; INVALID for NX_DEADLINE_NEVER; CONTEXT when "
"blocking is not permitted"
msgstr "到期后返回 SUCCESS；NX_DEADLINE_NEVER 返回 INVALID；不允许阻塞时返回 CONTEXT"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "Offer a scheduling opportunity without fairness guarantees."
msgstr "提供调度机会，不保证公平性。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "No promise about the next task, lower priorities or progress."
msgstr "不保证下一任务、低优先级任务或执行进度。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:22
msgid "SUCCESS or CONTEXT outside an allowed running task"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或在不允许的运行任务上下文中返回 CONTEXT"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:28
msgid "notify.h"
msgstr "notify.h"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "Portable single-waiter latched notifications."
msgstr "可移植的单等待者锁存通知。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "Caller-owned notification with one waiter and multiple publishers."
msgstr "调用者拥有的通知，支持一个等待者和多个发布者。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "Initialize unused zeroed notification storage."
msgstr "初始化已清零且未使用的通知存储。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "Task/bootstrap only; one external lifecycle owner."
msgstr "仅限任务／引导阶段；由一个外部生命周期所有者管理。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "[inout] Object retained through all port users"
msgstr "[inout] 对象，保留到所有端口使用者退出"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or admission/initialization error; BUSY can retain resources that "
"require destroy before retry"
msgstr "SUCCESS 或准入／初始化错误；BUSY 可能保留资源，重试前必须先 destroy"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "Bind the existing sequence-hint wait protocol."
msgstr "绑定现有的序列提示等待协议。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid ""
"arm/wait have one owner. port.wake accepts only the backend's admitted "
"task/bootstrap or hardware IRQ domain. Read authoritative predicates after "
"hints. A timeout never releases request buffers. Fewer than 2^32 wakes may "
"occur between arm and recheck; see wait.h for the full contract."
msgstr ""
"arm/wait 由一个所有者执行。port.wake 仅接受后端准许的任务／引导或硬件 IRQ "
"发布域。收到提示后读取权威判定条件。超时绝不释放请求缓冲区。arm 与复查之间的唤醒次数必须少于 2^32；完整合同见 wait.h。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "[inout] Live object, retained through all publishers"
msgstr "[inout] 有效对象，保留到全部发布者退出"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "Wait port; an empty port for invalid/non-live storage"
msgstr "等待端口；存储无效或未处于有效状态时返回空端口"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "Publish a task/bootstrap notification hint."
msgstr "发布任务／引导阶段的通知提示。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid ""
"Admission rejects before publication. A kernel error may follow a published "
"hint and cannot revoke it. No transfer of business data ownership or "
"completion proof is implied."
msgstr "准入拒绝发生在发布之前。内核错误可能发生在提示已发布之后，不能撤回该提示。不隐含业务数据所有权转移或完成证明。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "[inout] Live object with stable storage"
msgstr "[inout] 具有稳定存储的有效对象"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "SUCCESS or an admission/kernel error"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或准入／内核错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "Publish from a validated configurable hardware IRQ."
msgstr "从经过验证的可配置硬件 IRQ 发布。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid ""
"No blocking. Validate masks, actual IRQ bounds and kernel syscall priority "
"before mutation. NMI/faults are unsupported."
msgstr "不阻塞。在修改前检查掩码、实际 IRQ 范围及内核系统调用优先级。不支持 NMI／故障上下文。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "[inout] Live object retained until IRQ quiescence"
msgstr "[inout] 有效对象，保留到 IRQ 发布源静默"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/CONTEXT/error; Native returns CONTEXT"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或 INVALID/CONTEXT/错误；Native 返回 CONTEXT"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "Destroy only after every publisher and waiter has exited."
msgstr "仅在全部发布者和等待者退出后销毁。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid ""
"Task lifecycle owner only. Busy checks cannot prevent a future caller racing"
" destruction. After partial failure, retain storage and retry destroy, never"
" reinitialize it."
msgstr "仅限任务生命周期所有者。忙状态检查不能阻止未来调用者与销毁发生竞争。部分失败后保留存储并重试 destroy，绝不重新初始化。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "[inout] Live object with no future users"
msgstr "[inout] 有效对象，不再有后续使用者"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:30
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/error retaining outstanding resources"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或保留未释放资源的 BUSY/错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:36
msgid "queue.h"
msgstr "queue.h"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "Portable bounded byte-copy queues without close broadcasts."
msgstr "可移植的有界字节复制队列，不包含关闭广播。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "Caller-owned control; payload storage is supplied separately."
msgstr "调用者拥有控制对象，数据存储另外提供。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "Initialize an exact logical depth and item size."
msgstr "初始化精确的逻辑深度和消息大小。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid ""
"Task/bootstrap only. Reject multiplication/span overflow and complete "
"control/payload overlap before kernel effects. No allocator or global pool. "
"Partial cleanup retains storage."
msgstr "仅限任务／引导阶段。在产生内核效果前拒绝乘法／地址范围溢出，以及完整控制对象与数据存储的重叠。没有分配器或全局池。部分清理失败时保留存储。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "[inout] Unused zeroed control, retained until destroy"
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的未使用控制对象，保留到 destroy"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "[in] Caller payload buffer, retained until destroy"
msgstr "[in] 调用者数据缓冲区，保留到 destroy"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[in] Actual capacity, at least depth * item_size"
msgstr "[in] 实际容量，至少为 depth * item_size"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "[in] Positive number of items"
msgstr "[in] 消息数量，必须大于零"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "[in] Positive number of bytes per item"
msgstr "[in] 每条消息的字节数，必须大于零"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "SUCCESS or admission/initialization error"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或准入／初始化错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "Copy an immediately available item before expiry."
msgstr "先复制立即可用的消息，再考虑过期。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid ""
"Running task only, including deadline zero (try). Copying a pointer does not"
" transfer its payload ownership. No ISR API."
msgstr "仅限运行中的任务，包括 deadline 为零的 try 操作。复制指针不会转移其数据所有权。没有 ISR API。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "[inout] Live queue retained throughout the operation"
msgstr "[inout] 存活队列，在整个操作期间保留"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "[in] item_size readable bytes, borrowed until return only"
msgstr "[in] item_size 个可读字节，仅借用到本次调用返回"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "SUCCESS after copy; TIMEOUT or error retains no new item"
msgstr "复制后返回 SUCCESS；TIMEOUT 或错误不保留本次新消息"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "Receive an available item before checking expiry."
msgstr "先接收可用消息，再检查过期。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "Running task only. Spurious wakes never renew the budget."
msgstr "仅限运行中的任务。虚假唤醒绝不重新开始预算。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[out] item_size writable bytes, changed only on SUCCESS"
msgstr "[out] item_size 个可写字节，仅在 SUCCESS 时修改"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[in] Absolute OS deadline; zero means try"
msgstr "[in] 绝对 OS 截止时间；零表示 try"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "SUCCESS, TIMEOUT or an admission/context/kernel error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、TIMEOUT，或准入／上下文／内核错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "Destroy a drained queue after every user quiesces."
msgstr "在所有使用者静默后销毁已排空队列。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid ""
"One task/bootstrap lifecycle owner. No close broadcast is implied; "
"applications must arrange caller termination."
msgstr "由一个任务／引导阶段生命周期所有者管理。不隐含关闭广播；应用必须安排调用者退出。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "[inout] Live control and payload, with no future calls"
msgstr "[inout] 有效控制对象及数据存储，不再有后续调用"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:38
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/error retaining remaining resources"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或保留剩余资源的 BUSY/错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:44
msgid "channel.h"
msgstr "channel.h"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Portable close-aware channels with caller-owned waiters."
msgstr "可移植的可感知关闭通道，使用调用者拥有的等待者。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Static close-aware byte queue; ordinary queues remain separate."
msgstr "可感知关闭的静态字节队列；普通队列保持独立。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "One exclusive caller-owned latch per simultaneous channel call."
msgstr "每个同时进行的通道调用都有独占的调用者锁存对象。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Initialize an unused operation waiter."
msgstr "初始化尚未使用的操作等待者。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Task/bootstrap only; never share one active waiter."
msgstr "仅限任务／引导阶段；绝不共享正在使用的等待者。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[inout] Zeroed storage retained until waiter destroy"
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的存储，保留到等待者 destroy"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Release an inactive waiter after its operation has returned."
msgstr "在操作返回后释放非活动等待者。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "One task lifecycle owner; failure never permits reuse."
msgstr "由一个任务生命周期所有者管理；失败绝不允许重用。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[inout] Live exclusive storage with no future operation"
msgstr "[inout] 有效的独占存储，不再有后续操作"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/error retaining resources"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或保留资源的 BUSY/错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Initialize a channel with explicit broadcast capacity."
msgstr "初始化具有明确广播容量的通道。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid ""
"Task/bootstrap only. Complete control/payload spans must not overlap or "
"wrap. No hidden waiter pool or worker."
msgstr "仅限任务／引导阶段。完整控制对象与数据缓冲区地址范围不得重叠或回绕。没有隐藏等待者池或工作线程。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[inout] Unused zeroed storage retained until destroy"
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的未使用存储，保留到 destroy"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[in] Payload buffer retained until destroy"
msgstr "[in] 数据缓冲区，保留到 destroy"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[in] Positive number of copied items"
msgstr "[in] 复制消息的数量，必须大于零"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[in] Positive bytes per item"
msgstr "[in] 每条消息的字节数，必须大于零"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[in] Positive maximum concurrent operations"
msgstr "[in] 最大并发操作数，必须大于零"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Close send admission and wake registered blockers."
msgstr "关闭发送准入并唤醒已登记的阻塞者。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid ""
"Task lifecycle owner. Existing items remain receivable. Close does not join "
"users, destroy storage or cancel I/O."
msgstr "由任务生命周期所有者调用。已有消息仍可接收。关闭不 join 使用者、不销毁存储，也不取消 I/O。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[inout] Live channel retained through all users"
msgstr "[inout] 有效通道，保留到所有使用者退出"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "SUCCESS (idempotent) or admission/context error"
msgstr "SUCCESS（幂等），或准入／上下文错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Copy an item or observe close without periodic polling."
msgstr "无需周期轮询即可复制消息或观察关闭。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Running task only. Closed sends never retain the item."
msgstr "仅限运行中的任务。被关闭拒绝的发送绝不保留本次消息。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[inout] Live channel retained throughout the call"
msgstr "[inout] 有效通道，保留到本次调用结束"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[in] item_size readable bytes, borrowed until return"
msgstr "[in] item_size 个可读字节，借用到返回"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[inout] Live exclusive waiter retained through this call"
msgstr "[inout] 有效的独占等待者，保留到本次调用结束"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "SUCCESS, CANCELLED after close, TIMEOUT, BUSY or error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、关闭后的 CANCELLED、TIMEOUT、BUSY 或错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Receive and drain data queued before close."
msgstr "接收并排空关闭前已入队的数据。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Running task only. Immediate readiness wins expiration."
msgstr "仅限运行中的任务。立即就绪优先于过期。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "SUCCESS; CANCELLED when closed and empty; TIMEOUT/BUSY/error"
msgstr "SUCCESS；关闭且为空时返回 CANCELLED；或 TIMEOUT/BUSY/错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "Destroy a closed, drained and externally quiesced channel."
msgstr "销毁已关闭、已排空且经外部会合静默的通道。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid ""
"Task lifecycle owner. Join publishers and waiters before destroy; completion"
" or a users count alone is insufficient."
msgstr "由任务生命周期所有者调用。destroy 前 join 全部发布者和等待者；仅有完成提示或 users 计数不够。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "[inout] Live control and payload with no future users"
msgstr "[inout] 有效控制对象及数据存储，不再有后续使用者"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:46
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/error retaining every outstanding resource"
msgstr "SUCCESS，或保留所有尚未释放资源的 BUSY/错误"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:52
msgid "storage.h"
msgstr "storage.h"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:54
msgid "Assembly-only selected static OS layouts and stack storage."
msgstr "仅供装配使用的选定静态 OS 布局和栈存储。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:54
msgid ""
"Business headers use the opaque public object references. Include this "
"header only where actual storage is defined. Link exactly one task backend; "
"native kernel headers remain an assembly dependency, not a business API. "
"Zero-initialize controls before first use. Never change live private fields."
msgstr ""
"业务头使用公共不透明对象引用。仅在定义实际存储处包含此头。只链接一个任务后端；原生内核头仅是装配依赖，不是业务 "
"API。控制对象首次使用前必须清零。绝不修改有效对象的私有字段。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:54
#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:112
#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:120
#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:128
msgid "Defines"
msgstr "宏定义"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:54
msgid ""
"Declare static native-word storage, rounded up to a positive byte size."
msgstr "声明静态原生栈元素存储，向上取整到所要求的正字节容量。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:54
msgid ""
"File/block scope only. Pass sizeof(name) as actual capacity to start. The "
"target compiler owns sizeof/alignment; no maximum union is used."
msgstr "仅限文件／代码块作用域。start 时传入 sizeof(name) 作为实际容量。sizeof／对齐由目标编译器决定，不使用最大联合体。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:60
msgid "baremetal.h"
msgstr "baremetal.h"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid "Bare-metal poll notification with caller-owned storage."
msgstr "使用调用者存储的裸机轮询通知。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid "Initialize storage before exposing it to any ISR."
msgstr "向任何 ISR 暴露存储之前先初始化。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid ""
"Startup context; not a task/queue emulation. Word publication uses the "
"reviewed inline compiler/CPU port."
msgstr "启动上下文；不模拟任务或队列。字发布使用经审查的内联编译器／CPU 端口。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid "[out] Unused caller-owned storage"
msgstr "[out] 尚未使用、由调用者拥有的存储"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid "[in] Monotonic microsecond source, continuing while waiting"
msgstr "[in] 单调微秒时间源，等待期间持续运行"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid "[in] Clock source context"
msgstr "[in] 时钟源上下文"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or NX_ERROR_INVALID"
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS 或 NX_ERROR_INVALID"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid "Bind the explicit polling notification."
msgstr "绑定显式轮询通知。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid ""
"wake uses compiler RMW or, on M0/M0+, a bounded saved PRIMASK guard. That "
"guard requires one CPU and privileged Thread/configurable-IRQ callers; "
"NMI/HardFault, unprivileged, DMA and other security-domain access to its "
"metadata are unsupported. The owner loop continues to service "
"controller/drain after BUSY. No WFI/WFE is inserted without a reviewed "
"architecture-specific atomic sleep contract."
msgstr ""
"wake 使用编译器读改写（RMW），在 M0/M0+ 上则使用保存原状态的有界 PRIMASK 保护。该保护仅适用于单 CPU 上的特权 "
"Thread／可配置 IRQ 调用者；不支持 NMI/HardFault、非特权代码、DMA 或其他安全域访问其元数据。返回 BUSY "
"后，所有者循环仍须继续服务控制器并推进排空。没有经过审查的架构专用原子睡眠合同，不插入 WFI/WFE。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid "[in] Initialized storage"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的存储"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid ""
"Port whose wait returns BUSY while unchanged before deadline; "
"NX_DEADLINE_NEVER disables expiry, never implies blocking"
msgstr "等待端口：截止时间前若状态未变，wait 返回 BUSY；NX_DEADLINE_NEVER 禁用到期，不意味着阻塞"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/api/os.md:62
msgid "Explicit nonblocking bare-metal notification storage."
msgstr "显式、非阻塞的裸机通知存储。"

